    "body": "LOGICAL_OWNER = LESTER\nROLE = IMPLEMENTER\nSTATE = ASSIGNED\nAUTHORITY = OWNER\nOWNER_COMMAND = AUTHORIZE LESTER ZORR REFERENCE BRIDGE V1 IMPLEMENTATION EXACT PLAN 29d96415afd2eefa8384ba0ff72eb35a3998630a\n\nSPEC_PATH = docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-27-zorr-reference-bridge-v1-design.md\nSPEC_HEAD = d18a5c40bd64127fe0d81876c1e9d7b134fd360c\nPLAN_PATH = docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-27-zorr-reference-bridge-v1.md\nPLAN_HEAD = 29d96415afd2eefa8384ba0ff72eb35a3998630a\nIMPLEMENTATION_BASE = 9e2ccfbaca88a95eac2e119e5eac720f9074dd35\nIMPLEMENTATION_BRANCH = agent-controller/reference-bridge-v1-implementation\n\n## EXECUTION CONTRACT\nUse an isolated worktree from exact IMPLEMENTATION_BASE. Read the approved spec and plan before touching code. Execute Tasks 1-8 continuously with strict TDD: RED must run/fail for the intended reason before GREEN. Commit at task boundaries. Maintain an SDD progress ledger. Use verification-before-completion before handoff.\n\n## TASKS\n1. Config + durable event contracts.\n2. Bridge GitHub discovery/evidence adapter.\n3. Local Drive delivery validation.\n4. Append-only journal + atomic publisher + quarantine.\n5. Bridge cycle orchestration + durable reference events.\n6. Bridge-only lock + health + runner + preflight.\n7. CLI + Windows Task Scheduler deployment.\n8. Example config + docs + full verification + handoff.\n\n## HARD SCOPE LOCKS\n- Create sibling package `agent-controller/src/zb_reference_bridge/`.\n- DO NOT modify any existing file under `agent-controller/src/zb_local_controller/`.\n- DO NOT modify Controller Daemon production runtime/config/deployment.\n- DO NOT modify SALVADOR model/workflow/prompt/denoise/dimensions.\n- DO NOT change ComfyUI lifecycle, Babylon, canon, or production activation.\n- Google Drive carries image bytes only; GitHub remains authority/evidence plane.\n- v1 = exactly one image per TASK_ID, png/jpg/jpeg/webp, non-empty, <=20 MiB.\n- `REFERENCE_EVENT != AGENT_EVENT`; bridge MUST NOT write `ZB_AGENT_EVENT_V0`.\n- No automatic overwrite/delete of an accepted inbox reference.\n- Google Drive Desktop installation/sign-in is NOT an implementation task; owner-PC setup occurs only after Duncan independent QC PASS.\n\n## REQUIRED HANDOFF\n`LESTER_REFERENCE_BRIDGE_V1_IMPLEMENTATION_READY`\nwith exact implementation HEAD, branch, base, SPEC_HEAD, PLAN_HEAD, Tasks 1-8 complete, focused Reference Bridge pytest result, full pytest result, compile PASS, Controller Daemon files changed NO, SALVADOR scope changed NO, Google Drive Desktop installed NO, owner-PC smoke NOT RUN, MERGE NO, PRODUCTION ACTIVATION NO.\n\n## NEXT GATE\nLESTER self-verification is not independent QC. After implementation handoff, only DUNCAN independently QC's exact HEAD before any owner-PC Drive installation or smoke.\n\nASSIGNED != RUNNING. RUNNING requires real implementation/session evidence.\nMERGE = NO\nPRODUCTION_ACTIVATION = NO",
